Package: fslogisticskampala
Title: Data on Faecal Sludge Transporting Logistics in Kampala, Uganda
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lars", "Schöbitz", , "lars@lse.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2196-5015")),
    person("Jos", "van der Ent", role = "ctb",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-3940-3943")))
Description:
    Contains two data resources. `trips` contains the GPS locations
    of faecal sludge emptying trucks collecting sludge from pit latrines and
    septic tanks in Kampala, Uganda. Each trip is recorded with a unique
    identifier, the numberplate of the truck, the date and time of the record.
    Data was collected from 30th March 2015 until 25th June 2015. `trucks` has
    additional information on the volume of each truck.
